<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8"/>
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/>
<title>Steven Garcia · Infrastructure &amp; Systems</title>
<meta name="description" content="Navy veteran running a seventeen VM homelab with a SIEM watching every host. Every project includes what went wrong."/>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=IBM+Plex+Sans+Condensed:wght@600;700&family=IBM+Plex+Sans:wght@400;500;600&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style is:global>
:root{
  --paper:#EDEFEA; --paper-2:#E4E7E0; --paper-3:#D9DED4;
  --ink:#121615; --ink-2:#3B443F; --muted:#6E7A73; --muted-2:#939E96;
  --line:#C9CFC5; --line-2:#DBDFD6;
  --oxide:#A0391F; --steel:#2B4759; --deck:#2E6049;
  --night:#12181B; --night-2:#1A2226; --night-line:#2C3840;
  --disp:'IBM Plex Sans Condensed',sans-serif;
  --body:'IBM Plex Sans',system-ui,sans-serif;
  --mono:'IBM Plex Mono',ui-monospace,monospace;
  --wrap:1220px;
}
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
body{background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink-2);font-family:var(--body);font-size:17px;line-height:1.62;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;overflow-x:hidden}
.wrap{max-width:var(--wrap);margin:0 auto;padding:0 34px}

/* nav */
.nav{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:80;transition:background .3s,border-color .3s}
.nav-in{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;height:64px}
.nav.solid{background:rgba(237,239,234,.94);backdrop-filter:blur(14px);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.brand{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:13px;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;color:#fff;transition:color .3s}
.nav.solid .brand{color:var(--ink)}
.led{width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:#4ED18C;box-shadow:0 0 8px #4ED18C;animation:blip 2.6s infinite}
.nav.solid .led{background:var(--deck);box-shadow:none}
@keyframes blip{0%,100%{opacity:1}50%{opacity:.3}}
.nav-links{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:24px;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12.5px}
.nav-links a{color:rgba(255,255,255,.72);text-decoration:none;transition:color .2s}
.nav.solid .nav-links a{color:var(--muted)}
.nav-links a:hover{color:#fff}
.nav.solid .nav-links a:hover{color:var(--oxide)}
.nav-cta{border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.4);padding:8px 16px;border-radius:3px;color:#fff!important}
.nav.solid .nav-cta{background:var(--ink);border-color:var(--ink);color:var(--paper)!important}
.nav.solid .nav-cta:hover{background:var(--oxide);border-color:var(--oxide);color:#fff!important}

/* hero */
.hero{position:relative;min-height:100svh;display:flex;align-items:flex-end;overflow:hidden;background:var(--night)}
.hero-bg{position:absolute;inset:0;overflow:hidden}
.hero-bg img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:58% 50%;filter:grayscale(1) contrast(1.18) brightness(.62);transform:scale(1.10);animation:slowpan 26s ease-out forwards}
@keyframes slowpan{to{transform:scale(1)}}
.hero-bg::after{content:'';position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(120deg,#A0391F 0%,#2B4759 100%);mix-blend-mode:color;opacity:.9}
.hero-scrim{position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(10,14,16,.72) 0%,rgba(10,14,16,.30) 32%,rgba(10,14,16,.86) 82%,#12181B 100%)}
.hero-rule{position:absolute;left:0;right:0;top:0;height:3px;background:var(--oxide);transform:scaleX(0);transform-origin:left;animation:wipe 1.1s .15s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1) forwards}
@keyframes wipe{to{transform:scaleX(1)}}
.hero-in{position:relative;z-index:2;width:100%;padding:0 0 64px}
.h-tag{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11.5px;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(255,255,255,.62);margin-bottom:20px}
h1{font-family:var(--disp);font-weight:700;line-height:.86;letter-spacing:-.04em;color:#fff;font-size:clamp(66px,13vw,178px);margin-bottom:26px}
h1 span{display:block;overflow:hidden}
h1 span i{display:block;font-style:normal;transform:translateY(102%);animation:rise .95s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1) forwards}
h1 span:nth-child(1) i{animation-delay:.28s}
h1 span:nth-child(2) i{animation-delay:.40s}
@keyframes rise{to{transform:translateY(0)}}
.h-sub{font-family:var(--disp);font-weight:600;font-size:clamp(22px,2.9vw,36px);line-height:1.14;letter-spacing:-.02em;color:#fff;max-width:21ch;opacity:0;animation:fade .9s .74s forwards}
.h-sub b{color:#F0A183;font-weight:600}
@keyframes fade{to{opacity:1}}
.h-acts{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:38px;opacity:0;animation:fade .9s .95s forwards}
.btn{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12.5px;font-weight:500;text-decoration:none;padding:14px 22px;border-radius:3px;border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--ink);background:var(--paper-2);transition:all .16s;display:inline-block}
.btn:hover{border-color:var(--ink);background:var(--paper-3)}
.btn-p{background:var(--oxide);border-color:var(--oxide);color:#fff}
.btn-p:hover{background:#B84428;border-color:#B84428}
.btn-ghost{background:transparent;border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.42);color:#fff}
.btn-ghost:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,.12);border-color:#fff}

/* ticker */
.ticker{border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.16);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.16);overflow:hidden;position:relative;z-index:2;background:rgba(10,14,16,.55)}
.tick-in{display:flex;width:max-content;animation:slide 42s linear infinite}
.tick-in span{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11.5px;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(255,255,255,.6);padding:13px 28px;white-space:nowrap;border-right:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12)}
.tick-in span b{color:#4ED18C;font-weight:500}
.tick-in span em{color:#F0A183;font-style:normal}
@keyframes slide{to{transform:translateX(-50%)}}

/* stat band */
.band{background:var(--night-2);color:#fff}
.band .stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}
.stat{padding:46px 34px;border-right:1px solid var(--night-line)}
.stat:last-child{border-right:0}
.stat-n{font-family:var(--disp);font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(48px,6vw,76px);line-height:1;letter-spacing:-.035em;color:#fff}
.stat-l{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.17em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#F0A183;margin-top:12px}
.stat-s{font-size:15.5px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.56);margin-top:10px;line-height:1.5;max-width:34ch}

/* photo divider bands */
.divider{position:relative;height:clamp(300px,42vh,440px);overflow:hidden;background:var(--night);display:flex;align-items:center}
.divider img{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;filter:grayscale(1) contrast(1.15) brightness(.55)}
.divider::after{content:'';position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(120deg,#A0391F 0%,#2B4759 100%);mix-blend-mode:color;opacity:.88}
.div-scrim{position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(10,14,16,.9) 0%,rgba(10,14,16,.55) 55%,rgba(10,14,16,.35) 100%)}
.div-in{position:relative;z-index:2;width:100%}
.div-q{font-family:var(--disp);font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(26px,3.6vw,46px);line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-.025em;color:#fff;max-width:24ch}
.div-a{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11.5px;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#F0A183;margin-top:18px}

/* scaffold */
.sec{padding:112px 0}
.sec+.sec{border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
.sec-head{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.02fr .98fr;gap:60px;align-items:end;margin-bottom:54px}
.eyebrow{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--oxide);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-bottom:20px}
.eyebrow::after{content:'';height:1px;flex:1;background:var(--line);max-width:64px}
h2{font-family:var(--disp);font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(38px,4.8vw,62px);line-height:1;letter-spacing:-.024em;color:var(--ink)}
.lede{color:var(--muted);font-size:18px;line-height:1.6;padding-bottom:4px}

/* schematic */
.plate{border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--paper-2);border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden}
.plate-top,.plate-btm{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:14px;padding:12px 20px;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.13em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted-2)}
.plate-top{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.plate-btm{border-top:1px solid var(--line);text-transform:none;letter-spacing:.04em}
.plate svg{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;padding:14px 10px}
.dw{stroke-dasharray:var(--L,600);stroke-dashoffset:var(--L,600)}
.drawn .dw{animation:draw 1.5s cubic-bezier(.4,0,.2,1) forwards}
.drawn .dw.d1{animation-delay:.05s}.drawn .dw.d2{animation-delay:.3s}
.drawn .dw.d3{animation-delay:.55s}.drawn .dw.d4{animation-delay:.8s}
@keyframes draw{to{stroke-dashoffset:0}}
.pop{opacity:0}
.drawn .pop{animation:fade .5s forwards}
.drawn .pop.p1{animation-delay:.7s}.drawn .pop.p2{animation-delay:.95s}
.drawn .pop.p3{animation-delay:1.2s}.drawn .pop.p4{animation-delay:1.6s}

/* incident log */
.logband{background:var(--night);color:rgba(255,255,255,.78);padding:112px 0}
.logband h2{color:#fff}
.logband .lede{color:rgba(255,255,255,.55)}
.logband .eyebrow{color:#F0A183}
.logband .eyebrow::after{background:var(--night-line)}
.ledger{border:1px solid var(--night-line);background:var(--night-2)}
.ledger-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;padding:14px 26px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--night-line);font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(255,255,255,.38)}
.entry{display:grid;grid-template-columns:150px 1fr;gap:34px;padding:32px 26px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--night-line)}
.entry:last-child{border-bottom:0}
.entry-meta{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.42);line-height:1.9}
.entry-no{font-family:var(--disp);font-weight:700;font-size:34px;color:var(--night-line);line-height:1;margin-bottom:8px}
.entry-t{font-family:var(--disp);font-weight:700;font-size:25px;letter-spacing:-.02em;color:#fff;margin-bottom:16px;line-height:1.08}
.row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:96px 1fr;gap:18px;margin-bottom:10px}
.row:last-child{margin-bottom:0}
.rk{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.13em;text-transform:uppercase;padding-top:5px}
.rk.a{color:#E8785A}.rk.b{color:#7FB4D4}.rk.c{color:#4ED18C}
.row p{font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.56;color:rgba(255,255,255,.7)}
.row p b{color:#fff;font-weight:600}

/* featured */
.hero-proj{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.15fr .85fr;border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--paper-2);text-decoration:none;color:inherit;transition:border-color .2s}
.hero-proj:hover{border-color:var(--ink)}
.hero-proj-img{background:var(--night);overflow:hidden;min-height:340px}
.hero-proj-img img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:top left;display:block}
.hero-proj-b{padding:44px 40px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center}
.hero-proj h3{font-family:var(--disp);font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(28px,3.2vw,40px);line-height:1.04;letter-spacing:-.025em;color:var(--ink);margin:14px 0 16px}
.hero-proj p{font-size:17.5px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.58}
.kpi{display:flex;gap:34px;margin-top:26px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.kpi div{border-left:2px solid var(--oxide);padding-left:14px}
.kpi b{font-family:var(--disp);font-weight:700;font-size:30px;color:var(--ink);display:block;line-height:1}
.kpi span{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.13em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted-2);display:block;margin-top:5px}
.chip{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:9.5px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--deck);border:1px solid var(--line);padding:4px 9px;align-self:flex-start;border-radius:2px}
.chip.ox{color:var(--oxide)}
.card-go{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11.5px;color:var(--oxide);margin-top:22px;font-weight:500}
.pair{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:20px;margin-top:20px}
.card{border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--paper-2);text-decoration:none;color:inherit;display:flex;flex-direction:column;transition:all .18s}
.card:hover{border-color:var(--ink);transform:translateY(-3px)}
.card-img{aspect-ratio:16/9;background:var(--night);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);overflow:hidden}
.card-img img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:top left;display:block}
.card-b{padding:24px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;flex:1}
.card-b .chip{margin-bottom:13px}
.card h3{font-family:var(--disp);font-weight:700;font-size:24px;line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-.02em;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:11px}
.card p{font-size:16px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.55;flex:1}
.more{margin-top:20px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--paper-2)}
.mrow{display:grid;grid-template-columns:28px 1fr auto;gap:20px;align-items:center;padding:18px 26px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line-2);text-decoration:none;color:inherit;transition:background .14s}
.mrow:last-child{border-bottom:0}
.mrow:hover{background:var(--paper-3)}
.mno{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;color:var(--muted-2)}
.mt{font-family:var(--disp);font-weight:600;font-size:18px;color:var(--ink)}
.md{font-size:15px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:2px}
.mc{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.13em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted-2);white-space:nowrap}

/* receipts */
.shots{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px}
.shot{border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--paper-2)}
.shot img{width:100%;display:block;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.shot figcaption{padding:17px 19px;font-size:15.5px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.55}
.shot figcaption b{color:var(--ink);font-weight:600}

/* stack */
.stack{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--paper-2)}
.sg{padding:24px;border-right:1px solid var(--line-2);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line-2)}
.sg:nth-child(3n){border-right:0}
.sg:nth-last-child(-n+3){border-bottom:0}
.sg h4{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10.5px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.15em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--steel);margin-bottom:11px}
.sg p{font-size:15.5px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.6}

/* faq */
.faq{border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--paper-2)}
details{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line-2)}
details:last-child{border-bottom:0}
summary{padding:22px 26px;cursor:pointer;list-style:none;font-family:var(--disp);font-weight:600;font-size:20px;color:var(--ink);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;align-items:center}
summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}
summary:hover{background:var(--paper-3)}
summary::after{content:'+';font-family:var(--mono);color:var(--oxide);font-size:19px}
details[open] summary::after{content:'\2013'}
details p{padding:0 26px 22px;color:var(--muted);font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.65;max-width:80ch}

/* close */
.c3s{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:18px;margin-top:52px}
.c3{border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--paper-2);padding:26px;text-decoration:none;color:inherit;transition:all .16s;display:block}
.c3:hover{border-color:var(--oxide);transform:translateY(-3px)}
.c3 h4{font-family:var(--disp);font-weight:700;font-size:20px;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:8px}
.c3 p{font-size:15.5px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.55}
.c3 span{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;color:var(--oxide);display:block;margin-top:15px;font-weight:500}
.look{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:26px;margin-top:52px;padding:28px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.lk{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.15em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted-2);margin-bottom:8px}
.lv{font-size:16px;color:var(--ink);line-height:1.5}
footer{padding:30px 0 46px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:22px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center}
.fn{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11.5px;color:var(--muted-2);line-height:1.8}
.fl{display:flex;gap:9px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.fl a{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11.5px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;border:1px solid var(--line);padding:8px 14px;border-radius:3px}
.fl a:hover{color:var(--oxide);border-color:var(--oxide)}

.rv{opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px);transition:opacity .6s ease,transform .6s ease}
.rv.in{opacity:1;transform:none}
a:focus-visible,summary:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--oxide);outline-offset:3px}

@media (max-width:980px){
  .hero-in{padding-bottom:44px}
  .sec-head{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:32px}
  .hero-proj{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .hero-proj-img{min-height:220px}
  .hero-proj-b{padding:30px 26px}
  .pair,.shots,.stack,.c3s,.band .stats{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .sg{border-right:0}
  .stat{border-right:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--night-line);padding:32px 26px}
  .stat:last-child{border-bottom:0}
  .look{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}
  .entry,.row{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:12px}
  .sec,.logband{padding:74px 0}
  .nav-links a:not(.nav-cta){display:none}
}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){
  *{animation:none!important;transition:none!important}
  .rv{opacity:1;transform:none}
  h1 span i{transform:none}.h-sub,.h-acts,.pop{opacity:1}
  .dw{stroke-dashoffset:0}
  .hero-bg img{transform:none}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<nav class="nav" id="nav"><div class="wrap nav-in">
  <a class="brand" href="/"><span class="led"></span>steven-garcia.dev</a>
  <div class="nav-links">
    <a href="#log">incidents</a><a href="#work">work</a><a href="#stack">stack</a>
    <a href="/infrastructure">infrastructure</a>
    <a class="nav-cta" href="/resume.pdf">Résumé</a>
  </div>
</div></nav>

<!-- HERO -->
<header class="hero">
  <div class="hero-bg">
    <img src="/photos/navy-watch.webp"
         alt="A Gas Turbine Systems Technician standing watch at an electrical plant control console"/>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-scrim"></div>
  <div class="hero-rule"></div>
  <div class="hero-in"><div class="wrap">
    <div class="h-tag">Infrastructure &amp; systems · San Antonio, Texas</div>
    <h1><span><i>Steven</i></span><span><i>Garcia</i></span></h1>
    <div class="h-sub">I stood watch on a warship's electrical plant. <b>Now I run the lab that breaks.</b></div>
    <div class="h-acts">
      <a class="btn btn-p" href="#log">Read the incident log</a>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="#work">See the projects</a>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/resume.pdf">Résumé (PDF)</a>
    </div>
  </div></div>
</header>

<div class="ticker"><div class="tick-in" id="tick"></div></div>

<!-- STATS -->
<section class="band"><div class="stats">
  <div class="stat"><div class="stat-n" data-count="17">0</div><div class="stat-l">Virtual machines</div><div class="stat-s">Five VLANs, default deny between segments, one Dell workstation.</div></div>
  <div class="stat"><div class="stat-n" data-count="7">0</div><div class="stat-l">Monitored hosts</div><div class="stat-s">Windows, Ubuntu and Oracle Linux reporting to a single SIEM.</div></div>
  <div class="stat"><div class="stat-n" data-count="11" data-suffix="s">0</div><div class="stat-l">Restore drill</div><div class="stat-s">Destroyed the cluster state deliberately, then brought it back.</div></div>
</div></section>

<!-- SCHEMATIC -->
<section class="sec rv"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="sec-head">
    <div><span class="eyebrow">The environment</span><h2>Not eight side projects.<br>One system.</h2></div>
    <p class="lede">Traffic arrives through two Cloudflare Tunnels, so no inbound ports are open on my network. A virtualized firewall routes five segments and denies traffic between them by default. Everything below runs on one hypervisor.</p>
  </div>
  <figure class="plate" id="plate">
